Brand logos used for the agents list, drawn single-colour on a 24 px grid.

claude.svg (Anthropic), openai.svg, gemini.svg (Google Gemini) and copilot.svg (GitHub Copilot)
are from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org, CC0 1.0 Universal). opencode.svg is redrawn
after the opencode favicon (https://github.com/sst/opencode, MIT).

The logos are trademarks of their respective owners and are used here only to identify the
agent they belong to.
